      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Has to be mentioned, this issue did not occur in the earlier months before the mentioned period while being the same social event and through the same avatar(s).\n\nIt seems to affect any late joiners' avatar, so it is not related to one specifc avatar and is more of a broader issue. I just listed my own avatar to answer the question directly.\n\nEarly joiners who were present before the world was full/capped seems to be unaffected by this.\n\nA user joining late would also see early joiners fine but late joiners would be the ones affected.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
