      "value": "@{6296efa7a664220b79452942|full_name}: For the information (especially date and time) I need exact details so I can cross reference things server side. Regarding the usage of the parameter compressor I would try uploading a version which does not use this, if you encounter the issue again try using that version and see if the issue persists. This would highlight the issue being the compressor or rule it out (which would be quite useful to know)",
