      "value": "@{6296efa7a664220b79452942|full_name}: This issue has been looked into for some time, and was thought to be resolved some weeks ago as reports stopped coming in. The issue with solving this has been a lack of reports with actionable details, in order to investigate and resolve an issue like this various specific details are needed and optimally reliable reproduction steps. Although you and others have given reproduction steps we haven't been able to reproduce it, it seems there's more to the issue which has yet to be worked out.",
